{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a100000000000001","type":"group","x":-1800,"y":-700,"width":1520,"height":2380,"color":"4","label":"Sprint Contract · Technical Alpha"},
		{"id":"a100000000000002","type":"group","x":-100,"y":-700,"width":1520,"height":2380,"color":"1","label":"Week 1 · De-risk · Hari 1–5"},
		{"id":"a100000000000003","type":"group","x":1600,"y":-700,"width":1520,"height":2380,"color":"2","label":"Week 2 · Vertical Slice · Hari 6–10"},
		{"id":"a100000000000004","type":"group","x":3300,"y":-700,"width":1520,"height":2380,"color":"3","label":"Week 3 · Buffer / Hardening · Hari 11–15"},
		{"id":"b000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# BrailleMe · Roadmap Technical Alpha\n**Solo developer · 15 hari maksimum · hasil inti Hari 10**\n\nAlur keputusan: kontrak → de-risk → vertical slice → selesai Hari 10 **atau** buffer hardening → Go / Pivot / No-go. Hari 11–15 tidak boleh menambah fitur baru.","x":-1800,"y":-1040,"width":6620,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000003","type":"text","text":"# Technical Alpha Contract\n\n**Target** — pembacaan Live satu baris Braille enam titik pada satu Android referensi.\n\n**Input** — alfabet A–Z + spasi, 3–12 sel, uncontracted, sisi timbul depan, permukaan datar, kondisi terkontrol.\n\n**Output** — teks stabil; TTS lokal hanya setelah tombol baca ditekan. Auto-speak hanya eksperimen.\n\n**Privasi** — offline, tanpa simpan gambar/hasil, tanpa isi scan di log.\n\n**Kapasitas** — 1 solo developer; Hari 1–10 core, Hari 11–15 buffer.\n\n**Dependency awal** — Android autofocus, sampel fisik, ground truth provisional.","x":-1740,"y":-310,"width":680,"height":650,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000005","type":"text","text":"# Evidence Gate Alpha\n\n**Corpus** — 30 baris fisik ber-ground-truth: 20 dev + 10 holdout; tiap holdout diuji pada 3 variasi tangkapan. Threshold dibekukan sebelum holdout.\n\n**Hard gate**\n- Stable-token precision ≥90%; coverage ≥60%.\n- p95 ROI layak → hasil stabil ≤2 detik.\n- Preview ≥24 FPS saat pipeline aktif.\n- 0 false utterance pada ≥12 scene negatif.\n- Tidak mengulang suara pada target yang sama.\n- Soak 10 menit: 0 crash, ANR, buffer/camera stall, atau pertumbuhan memori tanpa batas.\n- Release bekerja setelah reboot dalam airplane mode.\n- 0 fallback jaringan, gambar persisten, atau isi scan di log.\n- TalkBack: label jelas, fokus stabil, stop/repeat usable.\n\n**Gate 1 · Hari 5** — release memproses frame + grid/cell baseline tanpa buffer stall.\n\n**Gate 2 · Hari 10** — benchmark holdout + demo end-to-end menentukan selesai atau buffer.","x":-1740,"y":390,"width":680,"height":900,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# Referensi Praktis · gunakan saat implementasi dan review","x":-1800,"y":1850,"width":6620,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"file","file":"10 - Projects/BrailleMe/PRD - BrailleMe.md","x":-1740,"y":-570,"width":1400,"height":220,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b000000000000007","type":"text","text":"## Working agreement\n**Owner:** Solo developer · **Hari kerja relatif:** 1–15 · **DoR:** perangkat + sampel tersedia Hari 1 · **Bukti harian:** build/fixture/metric yang dapat diulang · **TBD sadar:** validator domain dan ground truth formal belum tersedia; hasil alpha bukan pengesahan standar Braille Indonesia.","x":-1740,"y":1330,"width":1400,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c000000000000001","type":"text","text":"# Hari 1 · Sprint Contract\n\n**Tujuan** — membekukan eksperimen dan bukti yang dicari.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — inventaris Android/autofocus dan sampel; tetapkan profil `id-latin-6dot-alpha-v0`; rancang 30 baris corpus, variasi capture, risiko domain, DoR/DoD.\n\n**Output** — device sheet, corpus plan, profile manifest, risk register v0, checklist DoR.\n\n**Dependency** — perangkat dan sampel Braille timbul tersedia.\n\n**Acceptance check** — scope/metric tertulis; setiap sampel punya ID + ground truth; tidak ada fitur di luar kontrak.\n\n**Risiko** — sampel tidak representatif atau orientasi sisi Braille ambigu.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":-40,"y":-570,"width":560,"height":650,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c000000000000002","type":"text","text":"# Hari 2 · Environment\n\n**Tujuan** — membuktikan toolchain debug dan release sejak awal.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — scaffold bare React Native; pin dependency matrix; kamera + permission; konfigurasi satu Android referensi; build debug dan release.\n\n**Output** — app shell, lockfile stabil, kamera tampil, catatan versi/ABI, APK release smoke-tested.\n\n**Dependency** — keputusan stack Hari 1 dan SDK/JDK/NDK kompatibel.\n\n**Acceptance check** — cold start; izin ditolak/diterima tertangani; preview kamera hidup pada debug dan release.\n\n**Risiko** — incompatibility RN/New Architecture/native packages.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":740,"y":-570,"width":620,"height":650,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b000000000000004","type":"text","text":"# Scope Guardrail\n\n## Masuk alpha\n- Live satu baris; A–Z dan spasi.\n- Hybrid CV, stabilisasi, status aksesibel.\n- Stop/repeat TTS lokal.\n- Benchmark release/offline.\n\n## Tegas di luar alpha\n- Mode Dokumen; angka; kapital; tanda baca.\n- Histori/save, TXT, ekspor file.\n- Multi-device, Play Store, production quality.\n\n## Aturan perubahan\nTemuan baru masuk backlog. Hanya perbaikan untuk melewati evidence gate boleh masuk sprint. Buffer tidak mengubah kontrak produk.","x":-1020,"y":-310,"width":680,"height":650,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"b000000000000006","type":"text","text":"# Baseline & Kontrak Internal\n\n**Pin awal**\n- React Native `0.86.2`\n- VisionCamera / worklets / resizer `5.2.2`\n- fast-tflite `3.0.1`\n- react-native-worklets `0.11.3`\n- Nitro Modules `0.36.5`\n\n**ScanStatus**\n`searching | quality_issue | candidate | stable | unsupported | error`\n\n**QualityReason**\n`blur | dark | glare | too_far | tilted | no_grid | low_confidence`\n\n**LiveScanEvent**\n`schemaVersion`, `sessionId`, `timestampMs`, `status`, `reason?`, `text?`, `confidence?`, normalized boxes, `decoderVersion`.\n\n**BrailleProfile**\n`id-latin-6dot-alpha-v0`; A–Z/spasi; uncontracted; front-side only.\n\n**Manifest** — version + hash decoder/model; CPU fallback; typed error mapping; telemetry hanya performa.","x":-1020,"y":390,"width":680,"height":900,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c000000000000003","type":"text","text":"# Hari 3 · Data & Decoder\n\n**Tujuan** — membuat ground truth dan decoder deterministik sebelum live CV.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — produksi 30 sampel satu baris; split tetap 20 dev/10 holdout; petakan bitmask enam titik ke A–Z/spasi; unit test valid/invalid/unsupported.\n\n**Output** — manifest corpus, fixture terkontrol, decoder versioned, test table A–Z/spasi.\n\n**Dependency** — profil alpha dan aturan penomoran dot beku.\n\n**Acceptance check** — semua pola valid decode tepat; holdout tidak dipakai tuning; fixture dapat dilacak ke ground truth.\n\n**Risiko** — leakage dev/holdout atau ground truth keliru.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":-40,"y":280,"width":680,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c000000000000004","type":"text","text":"# Hari 4 · Frame Pipeline\n\n**Tujuan** — membuat aliran frame bounded tanpa membebani JS/React.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — `useFrameOutput`; timestamp gate 5 Hz; `useAsyncRunner`; latest-only/drop-if-busy; native CV/Nitro boundary; DTO kecil via `scheduleOnRN`.\n\n**Output** — pipeline instrumented, counters accepted/dropped, typed event stub, disposal test.\n\n**Dependency** — kamera release Hari 2 dan interface event beku.\n\n**Acceptance check** — setiap frame output di-dispose tepat sekali; worker tak menumpuk; React state tidak menerima frame/bitmap/tensor/base64.\n\n**Risiko** — out-of-buffers, double-dispose, atau crossing thread terlalu berat.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":680,"y":280,"width":680,"height":500,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c000000000000005","type":"text","text":"# Hari 5 · Baseline / GATE 1\n\n**Tujuan** — menghapus risiko terbesar: frame lifecycle dan grid/cell baseline.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — quality check pada fixture; ROI kasar; deteksi dot/grid/cell baseline; ukur stage latency, accepted/dropped frame, dan preview FPS pada release.\n\n**Output** — release demo fixture → kandidat grid/cell; laporan Gate 1; failure slice awal.\n\n**Dependency** — corpus/decoder Hari 3 + pipeline Hari 4.\n\n**Acceptance check** — release memproses frame; tidak ada buffer stall/crash; kandidat cell dapat divisualkan tanpa menyimpan isi scan; keputusan lanjut terdokumentasi.\n\n**Risiko** — geometri sampel terlalu bervariasi atau pipeline native tidak stabil.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.\n\n> **Gate 1:** bila lifecycle gagal, hentikan tuning recognition dan stabilkan pipeline terlebih dahulu.","x":-40,"y":1040,"width":1400,"height":530,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000002","type":"text","text":"# Tips & Trick CV\n\n- Mulai dari **hybrid CV**: YUV → quality/ROI → dot/grid/cell → bitmask → decoder.\n- Pertahankan resolusi yang cukup untuk dot; jangan resize seluruh frame menjadi `28×28`. Crop per ROI/cell setelah grid stabil.\n- Urutkan eksperimen: kualitas input → geometri grid → okupansi dot → decoder → temporal stability.\n- Simpan fixture non-sensitif dengan ground truth dan parameter capture; jangan hanya menguji live.\n- Normalisasi koordinat box 0–1 agar tidak terikat resolusi/orientasi.\n- Pisahkan confidence quality, grid, cell, dan row; agregat minimum/robust lebih mudah didiagnosis daripada satu skor opaque.\n- Threshold dituning **hanya** pada 20 dev; bekukan sebelum membuka 10 holdout.\n- Abstain lebih baik daripada teks/suara salah. Scene tanpa Braille, blur, glare, partial row, dan pola unsupported harus negatif.\n- Gunakan overlay debug hanya pada build internal dan tanpa persist.\n- Ukur per-stage dengan monotonic clock; laporkan median/p95 dan dropped-frame ratio.\n\n**Sampling** — default 5 Hz. Pertimbangkan 10 Hz hanya bila p95 seluruh pipeline ≤100 ms dan preview/thermal tetap lulus.","x":-1800,"y":2040,"width":1520,"height":1040,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"d000000000000008","type":"text","text":"# Keputusan Akhir · Go / Pivot / No-go\n\n## GO\nSeluruh hard gate terpenuhi. Alpha membuktikan kelayakan engineering untuk scope terkunci; lanjutkan perencanaan MVP, bukan klaim production-ready.\n\n## PIVOT\nLifecycle dan offline aman, tetapi ≥1 target kualitas belum tercapai. Decision record wajib menyebut gate gagal, failure slice, perubahan pendekatan, biaya, dan eksperimen berikutnya.\n\n## NO-GO\nPada Hari 15 release build, frame lifecycle, atau guardrail offline masih tidak stabil. Hentikan perluasan; arsipkan evidence dan tentukan ulang feasibility/stack.\n\n**Selalu serahkan:** benchmark final, manifest/hash, known limitations, residual risks, backlog pasca-alpha, dan owner next step.","x":1260,"y":3860,"width":1300,"height":460,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"d000000000000003","type":"text","text":"# Code Advice & Pseudocode\n\n```ts\nconst asyncRunner = useAsyncRunner()\nconst frameOutput = useFrameOutput({\n  pixelFormat: 'yuv',\n  dropFramesWhileBusy: true,\n  onFrame(frame) {\n    'worklet'\n    if (!at5Hz(frame.timestamp)) {\n      frame.dispose()\n      return\n    }\n\n    const wasHandled = asyncRunner.runAsync(() => {\n      'worklet'\n      try {\n        const event = nativeScan(frame) // DTO kecil\n        if (event.shouldEmit) scheduleOnRN(publishEvent, event.dto)\n      } catch (error) {\n        scheduleOnRN(publishError, toErrorCode(error))\n      } finally {\n        frame.dispose() // tepat sekali untuk frame yang diterima runner\n      }\n    })\n\n    if (!wasHandled) frame.dispose() // runner sibuk: drop frame ini\n  },\n})\n```\n\n```ts\nif (qualityPass && sameText3x && roiConsistent && dwellMs >= 500) {\n  emitStable(candidate)\n}\nif (stable.key !== lastSpokenKey && userPressedRead) {\n  speakWithLocalVoice(stable.text)\n  lastSpokenKey = stable.key\n}\n```\n\n- `scheduleOnRN` hanya untuk status/DTO kecil; fungsi target harus didefinisikan pada RN runtime scope.\n- Frame, bitmap, tensor, base64 tidak masuk React state.\n- Latest-only; drop frame baru saat worker sibuk.\n- Disposal single-owner dan teruji pada success/error/drop.\n- Event dan decoder/model selalu punya schema/version/hash.\n- Log hanya timing, status code, counters—tanpa teks/gambar.","x":-100,"y":2040,"width":1520,"height":720,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c000000000000006","type":"text","text":"# Hari 6 · Live Acquisition\n\n**Tujuan** — hanya mengirim frame layak ke recognition.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — ROI, blur/exposure/glare/tilt/grid gate; panduan jarak/framing; mapping failure ke `QualityReason`; uji beberapa cahaya/sudut terkontrol.\n\n**Output** — quality classifier heuristik, overlay guidance, failure taxonomy, fixture negatif.\n\n**Dependency** — Gate 1 lulus dan ROI/grid baseline tersedia.\n\n**Acceptance check** — status kualitas berubah terbatas dan bermakna; frame buruk abstain; tidak ada spam state per frame.\n\n**Risiko** — threshold terlalu ketat menekan coverage atau terlalu longgar memicu false candidate.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":1660,"y":-570,"width":540,"height":650,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000007","type":"text","text":"# Hari 7 · Recognition\n\n**Tujuan** — mengubah cell layak menjadi pola enam titik dan teks.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — dot detection; grouping row/grid/cell; normalisasi orientasi; bitmask; decoder; confidence per cell dan agregat baris.\n\n**Output** — kandidat teks + normalized boxes + confidence; debug stage metrics tanpa isi scan di log.\n\n**Dependency** — quality/ROI Hari 6 dan decoder Hari 3.\n\n**Acceptance check** — dev set dapat dievaluasi per-stage; unsupported/low-confidence abstain; error grid terpisah dari error klasifikasi.\n\n**Risiko** — glare menghasilkan dot palsu atau cell grouping bergeser.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":2520,"y":-570,"width":540,"height":650,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000008","type":"text","text":"# Hari 8 · Stabilization & TTS\n\n**Tujuan** — mengeluarkan teks/suara hanya saat bukti temporal stabil.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — quality pass; 3 prediksi sama; ROI spatial consistency; dwell ≥500 ms; abstain/cooldown; tombol baca; local-only voice; audio focus; dedupe.\n\n**Output** — state machine candidate→stable, TTS controller, stable-event trace.\n\n**Dependency** — candidate text + confidence Hari 7.\n\n**Acceptance check** — target sama tidak diucapkan ulang; voice jaringan ditolak; quality issue mereset kandidat secara aman.\n\n**Risiko** — oscillation, latensi berlebih, atau TTS memberi false utterance.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":1660,"y":280,"width":540,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000009","type":"text","text":"# Hari 9 · UX & Guardrail\n\n**Tujuan** — membuat vertical slice aman, offline, dan dapat dipakai dengan TalkBack.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — status aksesibel; stop/repeat; fokus tidak berubah per frame; lifecycle background/foreground; airplane mode; audit cache/log/persist; scene negatif.\n\n**Output** — flow Live lengkap, accessibility checklist, privacy/offline evidence, negative corpus ≥12 scene.\n\n**Dependency** — stabilizer/TTS Hari 8 dan build release.\n\n**Acceptance check** — kontrol berlabel; fokus stabil; stop/repeat usable; tak ada gambar/teks tersimpan atau jaringan.\n\n**Risiko** — announcement terlalu ramai, lifecycle mematikan kamera, atau engine TTS cloud-only.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":2520,"y":280,"width":540,"height":500,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c000000000000010","type":"text","text":"# Hari 10 · End-to-End / GATE 2\n\n**Tujuan** — menilai technical alpha dengan holdout, bukan intuisi demo.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — bekukan threshold; uji 10 holdout × 3 variasi; benchmark precision, coverage, p95 stable latency, FPS, false utterance; demo release setelah reboot + airplane mode; tulis known limitations.\n\n**Output** — evidence report Gate 2, rekaman demo non-sensitif, keputusan **selesai Hari 10** atau **gunakan buffer**.\n\n**Dependency** — vertical slice Hari 6–9; holdout belum pernah dituning.\n\n**Acceptance check** — semua hard gate diberi Pass/Fail + bukti; failure dipetakan per stage; keputusan tercatat.\n\n**Risiko** — demo tampak baik tetapi coverage/precision holdout gagal.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.\n\n> **Gate 2:** jangan mengubah threshold setelah melihat holdout tanpa membuat evaluasi baru yang terpisah.","x":1660,"y":1040,"width":1400,"height":530,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"c000000000000011","type":"text","text":"# Hari 11 · Failure Slicing\n\n**Tujuan** — menemukan bottleneck terbesar dari bukti Gate 2.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — slice gagal berdasarkan cahaya, sudut, jarak, simbol, dan tahap pipeline; bedakan acquisition/grid/classification/stabilization; uji reuse pipeline pada satu foto fixture.\n\n**Output** — ranked failure table, reproducer, satu bottleneck pilihan Hari 12.\n\n**Dependency** — Gate 2 memilih buffer dan evidence lengkap.\n\n**Acceptance check** — setiap kegagalan punya stage + reproducer + frekuensi; tidak ada fitur baru.\n\n**Risiko** — mengobati contoh tunggal atau mengubah banyak variabel sekaligus.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":3360,"y":-570,"width":480,"height":650,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000013","type":"text","text":"# Hari 13 · Performance\n\n**Tujuan** — membuktikan pipeline stabil pada sesi nyata.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — ukur latency stage-by-stage, preview FPS, accepted/dropped frame, memori, thermal; soak 10 menit; periksa backpressure dan CPU fallback.\n\n**Output** — performance profile release, soak log non-sensitif, bottleneck trace.\n\n**Dependency** — perbaikan Hari 12 selesai dan instrumentasi stabil.\n\n**Acceptance check** — ≥24 FPS; tidak ada crash/ANR/stall/unbounded memory; sampling tetap 5 Hz, naik 10 Hz hanya jika p95 pipeline ≤100 ms.\n\n**Risiko** — thermal throttling atau logging mengubah hasil.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":3360,"y":280,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000012","type":"text","text":"# Hari 12 · Perbaikan Tunggal\n\n**Tujuan** — memperbaiki satu bottleneck dengan dampak tertinggi.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — ubah satu tahap; A/B pada dev + regression fixtures; TFLite cell classifier hanya bila grid benar dan klasifikasi pola terbukti sumber error utama.\n\n**Output** — patch terukur, before/after metrics, manifest/version/hash baru bila decoder/model berubah.\n\n**Dependency** — failure ranking Hari 11.\n\n**Acceptance check** — target slice membaik tanpa regresi hard gate; holdout tidak menjadi data training/tuning.\n\n**Risiko** — scope creep, overfit, atau menambah model tanpa bukti.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":4280,"y":-570,"width":480,"height":650,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000014","type":"text","text":"# Hari 14 · Release Checks\n\n**Tujuan** — menutup risiko packaging, offline, aksesibilitas, dan privasi.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — AAB/release; audit Android 16 KB alignment; reboot + airplane mode; TalkBack; negative corpus; cache/log/permission; stop/repeat; background/foreground.\n\n**Output** — signed-like release artifact, release checklist, defect list final.\n\n**Dependency** — performance gate Hari 13.\n\n**Acceptance check** — artifact berjalan offline; native libs compliant; 0 network/persist/content log; 0 false utterance di ≥12 scene negatif.\n\n**Risiko** — debug/release drift, native binary alignment, atau voice lokal tidak tersedia.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":4280,"y":280,"width":480,"height":500,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"c000000000000015","type":"text","text":"# Hari 15 · Handoff / FINAL GATE\n\n**Tujuan** — menghasilkan keputusan yang dapat ditindaklanjuti.\n\n**Pekerjaan** — rerun benchmark final; rangkum known limitations dan residual risk; tutup risk register; susun backlog pasca-alpha; tandai setiap hard gate; pilih Go/Pivot/No-go.\n\n**Output** — final evidence pack, runbook demo, manifest versi, backlog prioritas, decision record.\n\n**Dependency** — release checks Hari 14 dan bukti Hari 10–13.\n\n**Acceptance check** — hasil reproducible; semua Fail punya owner/next step; tidak ada klaim production readiness.\n\n**Risiko** — menyamarkan fail sebagai sukses demo atau menunda keputusan tanpa bukti baru.\n\n**Owner** — Solo developer.","x":3360,"y":1040,"width":1400,"height":530,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000005","type":"text","text":"# Anti-pattern & Recovery\n\n## Hindari\n- Tuning pada holdout atau mengubah threshold setelah melihat hasil tanpa evaluasi baru.\n- Memasukkan frame/image/tensor ke JS/React state.\n- Queue tak terbatas, memproses setiap frame, atau menaikkan sampling sebelum profiling.\n- `dispose()` tersebar di banyak owner, lupa error path, atau double-dispose.\n- Satu confidence global tanpa diagnosis stage.\n- Menambah TFLite sebelum membuktikan classification adalah bottleneck.\n- Menyimpan screenshot, hasil scan, atau teks di log/crash report.\n- Auto-speak default, TTS cloud fallback, atau announcement per frame.\n- Menambah angka/kapital/dokumen/histori selama buffer.\n- Menganggap demo tunggal sebagai evidence.\n\n## Recovery order\n1. Stabilkan release + frame lifecycle.\n2. Validasi quality/ROI/grid pada fixture.\n3. Slice error per stage.\n4. Perbaiki satu bottleneck.\n5. Rerun regression + benchmark.\n\nJika release/lifecycle/offline gagal pada Hari 15, hasilnya **No-go**, bukan perpanjangan scope terselubung.","x":3300,"y":2040,"width":1520,"height":720,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"d000000000000004","type":"text","text":"# Testing & Evidence Playbook\n\n## Unit\n- Decoder A–Z/spasi, invalid/unsupported bitmask.\n- Typed error mapping, normalized box, stabilizer transitions, TTS dedupe.\n- Frame disposal exactly once pada success/error/drop.\n\n## Fixture / integration\n- Satu foto fixture menggunakan pipeline yang sama dengan live.\n- Golden dev fixtures untuk ROI/grid/cell/bitmask.\n- Regression: blur, dark, glare, tilted, too far, partial row.\n\n## Device / release\n- Permission deny/grant, cold start, reboot, background/foreground.\n- Airplane mode + local voice check.\n- TalkBack labels, traversal, fokus, stop/repeat.\n- Soak 10 menit: FPS, p95 stage latency, memory, thermal, drops.\n- AAB/native libs 16 KB page-size check.\n\n## Metric definitions\n- **Precision:** stable token benar / semua stable token.\n- **Coverage:** eligible attempts yang menghasilkan stable output.\n- **Stable latency:** ROI pertama layak → stable event.\n- **False utterance:** ucapan tanpa ground-truth eligible.\n\nSimpan environment, build hash, manifest version, device, capture condition, aggregate metrics, dan Pass/Fail. Jangan simpan isi scan di telemetry.","x":2720,"y":2040,"width":500,"height":720,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000006","type":"text","text":"# Selesai Hari 10\n\nSemua hard gate lulus. Bekukan artifact/evidence dan langsung buat decision record; Hari 11–15 tidak wajib dipakai untuk fitur baru.","x":1260,"y":3330,"width":270,"height":300,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"d000000000000007","type":"text","text":"# Buffer Hari 11–15\n\nSatu atau lebih gate kualitas/performance gagal tetapi release, lifecycle, dan guardrail cukup stabil untuk hardening terarah. Pilih satu bottleneck; tidak menambah fitur.","x":2180,"y":3330,"width":290,"height":300,"color":"3"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e000000000000001","fromNode":"b000000000000002","fromSide":"right","toNode":"c000000000000001","toSide":"left","label":"Kontrak → mulai"},
